WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 17]

01:34.399 --> 01:36.780
I didn't set the fire in Shijia Town.

01:36.800 --> 01:38.730
Still, he is the survivor.

01:38.750 --> 01:39.879
Fan Xian is still investigating

01:39.879 --> 01:41.700
your past deal with Northern Qi.

01:41.720 --> 01:43.479
All the more reason not to kill him.

01:43.519 --> 01:46.199
The Imperial Inspectorate surely knows
about this by now as you do.

01:47.119 --> 01:48.639
Let him investigate.

01:49.560 --> 01:52.119
I'm also curious about

01:53.159 --> 01:54.960
who set that fire.

01:57.280 --> 01:58.559
Where is that person?

01:58.679 --> 01:59.859
Tongfu Inn.

01:59.879 --> 02:00.700
The First Division

02:00.720 --> 02:02.340
secretly surrounded the place

02:02.360 --> 02:04.340
to prevent any sinister move.

02:04.360 --> 02:06.399
Deng Ziyue is thoughtful.

02:07.640 --> 02:08.720
Hold on.

02:08.890 --> 02:09.979
What's the name of the inn again?

02:09.999 --> 02:11.600
Tongfu Inn.

02:12.839 --> 02:14.600
What's the surname of the innkeeper?

02:15.320 --> 02:17.400
If it's Tongfu Inn,

02:17.519 --> 02:18.799
it should be Tong.

02:19.999 --> 02:21.840
Is it a man or a woman?

02:22.480 --> 02:23.959
Maybe a man.

02:24.200 --> 02:25.620
Mr. Fan, if you want a woman,

02:25.640 --> 02:27.379
I will get one for you.

02:27.399 --> 02:28.259
Scratch that.

02:28.279 --> 02:29.680
I didn't ask for anything.

02:32.640 --> 02:33.720
You,

02:33.999 --> 02:35.079
leave now.

02:35.119 --> 02:35.659
Godfather.

02:35.679 --> 02:36.659
Shut up.

02:36.679 --> 02:38.499
Scholars must have a backbone.

02:38.519 --> 02:39.040
Godfather, I...

02:39.040 --> 02:40.740
Don't be a shameless social climber.

02:40.760 --> 02:41.939
He Zongwei,

02:41.959 --> 02:43.740
I'm kind enough

02:43.760 --> 02:45.519
not to chuck you out.

02:45.839 --> 02:47.900
Educated men can't bend their knees,

02:47.920 --> 02:49.400
nor should they.

02:50.239 --> 02:51.480
I truly admire you, Godfather...

02:51.480 --> 02:52.560
Get lost!

02:57.079 --> 02:58.259
Godfather,

02:58.279 --> 02:59.759
I shall take my leave.

03:12.800 --> 03:14.539
He came here to offer
his service to you.

03:14.559 --> 03:15.819
I still have some pride.

03:15.839 --> 03:17.680
I won't take in someone like him.

03:18.160 --> 03:20.039
Hopefully, educated men

03:20.399 --> 03:22.079
won't demean themselves like he does.

03:22.399 --> 03:25.919
He is one in a million.

03:26.239 --> 03:29.320
Youngsters are mostly with pride.

03:29.399 --> 03:30.600
I hope so.

03:31.519 --> 03:32.340
Wang,

03:32.360 --> 03:34.600
let's go to the Tongfu Inn later.

03:36.279 --> 03:38.359
We are meeting the only survivor.

03:39.399 --> 03:43.680
Whether or not the aggrieved souls
of the Shijia Town can rest in peace

03:45.360 --> 03:46.680
depends on him.

03:56.239 --> 03:58.460
Educated men can't bend their knees,

03:58.480 --> 04:00.120
nor should they.

04:02.239 --> 04:03.919
What a fighting talk.

04:04.230 --> 04:05.840
But standing upright isn't easy.

04:08.839 --> 04:10.440
Yogurt for sale!

04:10.559 --> 04:12.919
Delicious yogurt!

04:13.040 --> 04:14.040
Please stop here.

04:14.040 --> 04:14.819
Until next time.

04:14.839 --> 04:15.580
Until next time.

04:15.600 --> 04:16.680
Safe trip.

04:24.720 --> 04:26.360
You are here, Mr. Fan.

04:26.639 --> 04:27.920
May I have a word?

04:34.040 --> 04:35.120
Mr. Fan.

04:35.239 --> 04:36.580
Does Shi Chanli stay here?

04:36.600 --> 04:38.920
Yes, in a quad room.

04:38.999 --> 04:40.659
The other three tenants
are also candidates.

04:40.679 --> 04:42.030
Here are their names.

04:45.520 --> 04:48.740
[Roommates]
Yang Wanli, Cheng Jialin, Hou Jichang.

04:48.760 --> 04:50.400
We are investigating
their family backgrounds.

04:50.400 --> 04:52.199
The results will be out soon.

04:52.239 --> 04:53.360
Besides, sir,

04:53.439 --> 04:56.659
this is a detailed record of Shi Chanli's activity
since he checked into the inn.

04:56.679 --> 04:57.839
Please review it.

04:57.960 --> 04:59.440
You even investigated this.

05:00.040 --> 05:01.659
It's always good to be well-prepared.

05:01.679 --> 05:03.320
In case you need it.

05:03.425 --> 05:05.040
[Shi Chanli]

05:05.040 --> 05:06.219
He even drank?

05:06.239 --> 05:08.199
He had a joyful conversation
with the other three

05:08.199 --> 05:09.179
and had a few drinks.

05:09.199 --> 05:10.759
He is not a good drinker.

05:11.639 --> 05:12.979
He is not in the inn now?

05:12.999 --> 05:14.079
Yes.

05:14.239 --> 05:16.240
He is in the exam hall.

05:16.970 --> 05:18.360
There are still a few days
until the exam.

05:18.360 --> 05:19.859
What is he doing there?

05:19.879 --> 05:22.040
He is building walls.

05:24.480 --> 05:25.639
Building walls?

05:25.999 --> 05:27.279
Be careful.

05:28.639 --> 05:29.739
Gently.

05:29.759 --> 05:30.239
Slowly.

05:30.239 --> 05:31.320
All right.

05:36.079 --> 05:36.739
Mr. Fan, please look.

05:36.759 --> 05:39.079
They are the candidates
for the coming spring exam.

05:40.160 --> 05:41.280
What are they doing?

05:41.300 --> 05:43.460
They are helping the Ministry of Rites
to renovate the exam hall.

05:43.480 --> 05:45.079
Renovate the exam hall?

05:45.559 --> 05:46.700
Isn't this the builders' work?

05:46.720 --> 05:48.140
Why are these candidates doing that?

05:48.160 --> 05:49.279
Yes.

05:50.079 --> 05:52.719
The Minister of Rites,
Mr. Guo Zheng, suggested this.

05:52.800 --> 05:54.790
He said there are many candidates

05:54.810 --> 05:56.430
who come
from different family backgrounds.

05:56.450 --> 05:58.020
Plus, the cost of living
in the Capital is high,

05:58.040 --> 06:00.320
which might be a burden
for students of humble roots.

06:00.800 --> 06:03.460
So it's better to pay the money
to these students

06:03.480 --> 06:04.880
than the builders.

06:05.280 --> 06:06.419
Exactly.

06:06.439 --> 06:07.219
It's voluntary.

06:07.239 --> 06:10.539
They can feel the grandness
of the exam hall in advance

06:10.559 --> 06:13.480
and earn some money
to make a living.

06:14.119 --> 06:15.380
By the look of it,

06:15.400 --> 06:16.880
this minister

06:16.960 --> 06:18.839
does take pity on the people.

06:24.360 --> 06:26.480
Mr. Fan, that's Mr. Guo.

06:27.759 --> 06:29.059
Mr. Guo would rather

06:29.079 --> 06:30.800
get his hands dirty.

06:33.360 --> 06:35.820
But why isn't he moving?

06:35.840 --> 06:37.120
Get stuck there?

06:59.079 --> 07:00.800
Here's a painter.

07:13.999 --> 07:15.839
Indeed.

07:17.080 --> 07:19.280
The renovation of the exam hall
is considered quite a contribution.

07:19.280 --> 07:20.820
Naturally, he would want
to record this moment.

07:20.840 --> 07:23.759
Some of the officials
have this preference.

07:24.639 --> 07:25.920
Interesting.

07:27.559 --> 07:30.159
Why don't we get a portrait
after we go back to the First Division?

07:32.910 --> 07:34.240
Where is Shi Chanli?

07:36.920 --> 07:38.920
Mr. Fan, he is over there.

07:45.480 --> 07:47.079
Is he striking a pose too?

07:49.759 --> 07:51.639
But there isn't any painter around.

07:52.030 --> 07:53.719
The guards are not strict, though.

07:54.639 --> 07:56.419
The guards are protecting the minister.

07:56.439 --> 07:57.979
No one cares about these candidates.

07:57.999 --> 07:59.560
We need two more people here.

08:05.439 --> 08:06.839
He Zongwei.

08:13.879 --> 08:16.320
Do you want to become an official?

08:21.040 --> 08:23.460
Will you take the risk

08:23.480 --> 08:27.079
for a chance to succeed?

08:31.480 --> 08:33.040
May I know who you are?

08:35.079 --> 08:36.680
Be careful, everyone.

08:38.000 --> 08:39.080
Shi.

08:41.280 --> 08:42.599
Who are you?

08:43.079 --> 08:44.380
Shi, you forgot me.

08:44.400 --> 08:45.680
We met before.

08:46.400 --> 08:47.500
Did we?

08:47.520 --> 08:49.299
Shi, are you staying in the Tongfu Inn?

08:49.319 --> 08:49.900
Yes.

08:49.920 --> 08:50.819
In a quad room?

08:50.839 --> 08:51.919
That's right.

08:52.040 --> 08:53.420
You come from Shijia Town on the border.

08:53.440 --> 08:54.659
How did you know everything?

08:54.679 --> 08:56.020
You told me.

08:56.040 --> 08:57.440
Did I?

08:57.490 --> 08:59.640
We chatted a little over some drinks
that night.

09:01.240 --> 09:02.599
Were you there?

09:04.000 --> 09:05.440
We were in the loo.

09:06.439 --> 09:07.550
I was drunk that night.

09:07.570 --> 09:08.800
I couldn't remember.

09:08.920 --> 09:10.860
Shi, are you short of money?

09:10.880 --> 09:12.140
Well, kind of.

09:12.160 --> 09:13.719
Takes one to know one.

09:16.679 --> 09:17.260
I'm Hou Jichang.

09:17.280 --> 09:19.500
[Hou Jichang, candidate in the spring exam]
Let me find your name.

09:19.520 --> 09:20.600
Hey, Shi.

09:21.479 --> 09:23.719
Is he your friend?

09:23.839 --> 09:25.020
I also stay in Tongfu Inn.

09:25.040 --> 09:26.350
We met before.

09:26.370 --> 09:28.390
Shi, why don't you introduce us
to one another?

09:30.160 --> 09:31.959
This is my roommate, Hou.

09:32.240 --> 09:33.359
Hou Jichang.

09:34.000 --> 09:35.800
Hi, Hou. My surname is Fan.

09:36.479 --> 09:37.559
Fan?

09:37.920 --> 09:38.939
Hi, Fan.

09:38.959 --> 09:40.800
We are fated
since we stay in the same inn.

09:41.240 --> 09:43.380
Did I interrupt you?

09:43.400 --> 09:44.520
Not at all.

09:44.640 --> 09:45.699
Just now,

09:45.719 --> 09:48.880
I saw you holding a brick

09:48.880 --> 09:49.659
and zoning out.

09:49.679 --> 09:50.839
What's wrong?

09:51.439 --> 09:52.680
I saw that too.

09:53.559 --> 09:54.380
Shi,

09:54.400 --> 09:56.380
[Shi Chanli]
did you forget what I told you?

09:56.400 --> 09:57.719
I saw you sitting there

09:57.719 --> 09:59.740
and staring at the two bricks
from a distance.

10:00.000 --> 10:01.699
Mr. Guo is monitoring the site.

10:01.719 --> 10:02.780
Even if you are tired,

10:02.800 --> 10:05.239
you have to pretend to be hardworking.

10:06.280 --> 10:07.459
I'm not tired.

10:07.479 --> 10:09.760
I just found these bricks strange.

10:12.520 --> 10:14.079
What's strange about the bricks?

10:15.800 --> 10:16.920
Let me show you.

10:20.000 --> 10:21.080
This

10:21.400 --> 10:23.359
is the old brick,

10:23.679 --> 10:24.839
and this

10:25.000 --> 10:26.760
is the new replacement brick.

10:27.079 --> 10:28.159
So?

10:28.599 --> 10:29.719
The new brick.

10:31.160 --> 10:32.240
The old brick.

10:33.230 --> 10:34.790
Can you tell from the sounds?

10:36.920 --> 10:39.059
The old brick sounds like an iron.

10:39.079 --> 10:40.160
Iron?

10:40.240 --> 10:42.380
This is the best kiln brick.

10:42.400 --> 10:44.699
Kiln bricks are extremely expensive.

10:44.719 --> 10:46.419
However, the replacement bricks

10:46.439 --> 10:48.359
are very ordinary bricks.

10:48.800 --> 10:50.040
Look at this too.

10:50.240 --> 10:51.800
The pillars taken down

10:52.319 --> 10:54.520
are Phoebe Zhennan.

10:55.520 --> 10:57.400
Look at the replacement pillars.

10:58.110 --> 10:59.440
Do you know what these are?

10:59.479 --> 11:01.220
They are just logs.

11:01.240 --> 11:02.100
They are ordinary.

11:02.120 --> 11:03.440
Too ordinary.

11:04.007 --> 11:05.299
That's why I'm confused.

11:05.319 --> 11:07.299
Why are they using

11:07.319 --> 11:08.830
a more inferior material

11:08.850 --> 11:10.100
for the renovation of the exam hall?

11:10.120 --> 11:11.879
Shi, how do you know about these things?

11:12.240 --> 11:13.539
I run a business back in my hometown,

11:13.559 --> 11:14.679
so I have some knowledge of this.

11:14.679 --> 11:15.699
I'm sure about this.

11:15.719 --> 11:16.799
Shi.

11:17.040 --> 11:19.339
Don't mention this ever again.

11:19.359 --> 11:20.439
Why not?

11:21.801 --> 11:25.601
Mr. Guo supervises
the renovation personally.

11:30.920 --> 11:32.319
All the more reason to inform Mr. Guo,

11:32.319 --> 11:33.780
so that he won't be shortchanged.

11:33.800 --> 11:36.079
This is none of our business.

11:36.280 --> 11:37.400
We had better

11:37.559 --> 11:38.620
ignore this.

11:38.640 --> 11:39.299
But...

11:39.319 --> 11:40.599
Trust me.

11:43.319 --> 11:44.780
Why ignore?

11:44.800 --> 11:47.220
Substituting with poor materials
is a corrupt behavior.

11:47.240 --> 11:49.040
We well-educated men
should be sensible and ethical.

11:49.040 --> 11:50.120
Why could we ignore this?

11:50.120 --> 11:51.479
Lower your voice.

11:55.510 --> 11:57.720
Please don't mind them.
They are always like this.

11:58.319 --> 11:59.740
Even if you can cover my mouth,

11:59.760 --> 12:01.599
you can't cover others'...

12:03.120 --> 12:04.599
I beg of you.

12:04.760 --> 12:06.879
Let me finish first.

12:08.719 --> 12:09.959
Fan, please have some water.

12:09.959 --> 12:11.140
Sure, thank you.

12:11.160 --> 12:12.459
Let me introduce him to you.

12:12.479 --> 12:14.020
This is Yang Wanli from Quanzhou.

12:14.040 --> 12:15.359
He is quite famous in his hometown.

12:15.359 --> 12:16.939
He is the top graduate
in the provincial exam.

12:16.959 --> 12:17.980
Among the four of us,

12:18.000 --> 12:19.640
Yang is the most knowledgeable.

12:20.000 --> 12:21.180
Nice to meet you, Yang.

12:21.200 --> 12:22.359
Likewise.

12:27.580 --> 12:28.520
I will go and sound the yamen's drum...

12:28.520 --> 12:30.719
Being book-smart isn't enough.

12:30.839 --> 12:32.419
Even if you want to report corruption,

12:32.439 --> 12:33.419
who will believe

12:33.439 --> 12:34.640
people like us?

12:35.359 --> 12:36.659
I heard that Mr. Fan

12:36.679 --> 12:37.079
is...

12:37.079 --> 12:38.400
Do you even know him?

12:39.840 --> 12:41.020
I can try to get to know him.

12:41.040 --> 12:42.879
Does Mr. Guo know Mr. Fan?

12:43.120 --> 12:43.740
Of course.

12:43.760 --> 12:46.280
Who among you two is closer to Mr. Fan?

12:46.359 --> 12:47.439
Mr. Guo.

12:47.520 --> 12:50.059
They preside over
the spring exam together.

12:50.079 --> 12:51.350
What if

12:51.370 --> 12:52.960
they came to a consensus on this?

12:54.460 --> 12:56.350
[Yang Wanli, candidate of the spring exam]
I see what you mean.

12:56.359 --> 12:57.599
You are saying

12:57.800 --> 13:00.119
that Mr. Fan and Mr. Guo

13:00.640 --> 13:02.780
are in cahoots...

13:02.800 --> 13:04.450
I didn't mean that.

13:04.470 --> 13:05.380
What did you mean, then?

13:05.400 --> 13:06.740
What I'm trying to say is,

13:07.760 --> 13:08.579
put up with that.

13:08.599 --> 13:09.719
Don't ever bring this up again.

13:09.719 --> 13:12.199
If I were to tolerate this,
what's the point of studying?

13:13.510 --> 13:14.939
If you want to intervene with this,

13:14.959 --> 13:16.320
now is not the time.

13:16.640 --> 13:17.939
When?

13:17.959 --> 13:19.280
Yang, let me ask you.

13:19.920 --> 13:21.599
Why did we come to the Capital?

13:23.460 --> 13:24.260
To become officials.

13:24.280 --> 13:26.190
Then, why are we working
on the renovation here?

13:26.210 --> 13:27.220
To become officials.

13:27.240 --> 13:28.740
If so, are you an official now?

13:28.760 --> 13:29.780
No.

13:29.800 --> 13:31.020
If you want to intervene,

13:31.040 --> 13:33.719
tolerate it until we gain power.

13:39.839 --> 13:41.319
Do educated men really
have to endure this?

13:41.319 --> 13:42.680
This is the norm.

13:44.350 --> 13:45.570
I will take my leave.

13:45.959 --> 13:46.939
Yang.

13:46.959 --> 13:48.120
Yang.

13:50.760 --> 13:51.980
How come a scholar

13:52.000 --> 13:53.440
is so reckless?

13:55.959 --> 13:57.039
Hou,

13:57.160 --> 13:58.300
just now,

13:58.320 --> 14:00.980
you said everyone came here
because they want to become officials.

14:01.000 --> 14:02.240
What does that mean?

14:02.760 --> 14:03.879
Nothing.

14:03.959 --> 14:05.400
Life is hard.

14:05.479 --> 14:07.239
We are just making a living here.

14:07.880 --> 14:08.900
Besides money,

14:08.920 --> 14:10.040
Hou also told us more

14:10.040 --> 14:12.020
about this renovation work.

14:12.040 --> 14:12.500
Shi.

14:12.520 --> 14:13.260
Don't worry.

14:13.280 --> 14:13.679
Shi...

14:13.679 --> 14:14.459
We are candidates.

14:14.479 --> 14:14.839
Shi...

14:14.839 --> 14:15.999
We should share.

14:16.079 --> 14:17.059
Hou said

14:17.079 --> 14:18.140
we came here to work

14:18.160 --> 14:19.500
not only for money,

14:19.520 --> 14:21.339
but also to show our faces.

14:21.359 --> 14:22.419
Show our faces?

14:22.439 --> 14:24.020
Candidates who came here

14:24.040 --> 14:26.040
have their names registered.

14:26.319 --> 14:28.459
Mr. Guo is here on the site.

14:28.479 --> 14:29.539
It would be best

14:29.559 --> 14:32.179
if he could remember our names.

14:32.199 --> 14:33.599
Remember our names?

14:41.040 --> 14:42.160
Fan, you see.

14:42.640 --> 14:44.459
There are so many candidates.

14:44.479 --> 14:46.140
If our names could be remembered,

14:46.160 --> 14:48.020
we could leave him
with a good impression.

14:48.040 --> 14:49.699
Maybe he might take an extra look

14:49.719 --> 14:51.999
when he reviews our exam papers.

14:53.679 --> 14:55.640
Hou, you are thinking ahead.

14:56.520 --> 14:58.999
Otherwise, people like us

14:59.520 --> 15:01.160
wouldn't be able to pass the exam.

15:01.730 --> 15:03.840
Isn't the spring exam
assessing our knowledge?

15:03.880 --> 15:06.860
Knowledge is useless
if we come from a humble background.

15:06.880 --> 15:08.720
How is that related to one's background?

15:08.760 --> 15:10.239
Mr. Fan, let me tell you this.

15:10.599 --> 15:12.879
Candidates in the spring exam every year

15:14.240 --> 15:15.839
are too many to count.

15:16.800 --> 15:19.400
However, there are only limited quotas
for each department.

15:20.510 --> 15:22.199
There are rumors circulating

15:22.800 --> 15:24.299
that the court officials,

15:24.319 --> 15:25.380
someone from the palace,

15:25.400 --> 15:26.400
and the imperial academy

15:26.400 --> 15:28.070
would select some candidates
and famous scholars.

15:28.079 --> 15:29.940
Consequently,
there aren't many spots left.

15:29.960 --> 15:32.060
How come they begin to select candidates
even before the exam?

15:32.080 --> 15:33.700
People who are of means
and with backgrounds

15:33.720 --> 15:34.679
would seek apprenticeships

15:34.680 --> 15:36.050
and offer their services to dignitaries.

15:36.050 --> 15:37.240
Seeing as they would eventually
become peers in court,

15:37.240 --> 15:39.070
those dignitaries would undoubtedly

15:39.120 --> 15:41.400
help their own disciples.

15:41.880 --> 15:42.840
What's the point of all that?

15:42.840 --> 15:44.459
Candidates will only be evaluated

15:44.479 --> 15:45.490
by their knowledge.

15:45.510 --> 15:46.959
Obtaining special favors

15:47.800 --> 15:50.110
is more effective
than having a knowledgeable mind.

15:50.400 --> 15:51.539
From what you said,

15:51.559 --> 15:53.199
this spring exam

15:53.400 --> 15:56.100
is held for the court officials
to choose lackeys.

15:56.120 --> 15:57.839
Yang, mind your mouth.

15:58.400 --> 16:00.479
You might lose your life
for saying that.

16:02.040 --> 16:03.000
Fan,

16:03.020 --> 16:04.440
don't take it too seriously.

16:04.560 --> 16:06.079
Don't get yourself in trouble.

16:09.560 --> 16:11.320
Selecting candidates before the exam

16:11.350 --> 16:13.160
and using the exam as a smokescreen.

16:14.800 --> 16:16.320
Isn't this cheating?

16:16.400 --> 16:17.160
That's right.

16:17.160 --> 16:18.479
Not so loud.

16:20.959 --> 16:22.520
I'm wondering

16:22.839 --> 16:24.400
if this is true,

16:24.470 --> 16:26.059
why hasn't anyone exposed
this situation?

16:26.079 --> 16:27.159
Expose whom?

16:27.679 --> 16:28.999
The justice court

16:29.959 --> 16:31.140
is also run by officials.

16:31.160 --> 16:32.339
Where is fairness?

16:32.359 --> 16:32.939
What did you say?

16:32.959 --> 16:33.659
Fairness.

16:33.679 --> 16:35.160
There is no such thing.

16:35.199 --> 16:36.599
Without fairness,

16:36.800 --> 16:38.120
isn't this spring exam

16:38.280 --> 16:39.719
a laughable joke?

16:40.359 --> 16:41.560
Perhaps

16:42.000 --> 16:43.680
we could change this

16:44.400 --> 16:46.199
when we succeed.

16:49.920 --> 16:51.239
Where is Cheng Jialin?

16:51.510 --> 16:53.220
He is breaking stones in the backyard.

16:53.240 --> 16:54.479
I told him

16:55.040 --> 16:56.359
to keep his mouth shut.

16:57.439 --> 16:58.959
Now I think of it,

16:59.000 --> 17:00.479
this is truly meaningless.

17:00.920 --> 17:02.000
I'm back to work.

17:02.640 --> 17:03.720
Shi.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.919
Be discreet.

17:11.559 --> 17:12.639
Fan.

17:13.840 --> 17:15.079
Can you do me a favor?

17:17.359 --> 17:18.520
Hou Jichang.

17:18.760 --> 17:19.980
You are so well done!

17:20.000 --> 17:21.780
You have carried so many logs
by yourself.

17:21.800 --> 17:22.680
It's my duty.

17:22.680 --> 17:24.079
Good work.

17:24.119 --> 17:25.040
Do you want to take a rest?

17:25.040 --> 17:26.859
You haven't had any water
since this morning.

17:26.879 --> 17:27.780
It's fine.

17:27.800 --> 17:28.480
It's my duty.

17:28.480 --> 17:29.619
Are you sure?

17:29.639 --> 17:31.059
Let me give you a hand.

17:31.079 --> 17:31.899
That's enough.

17:31.919 --> 17:33.020
Enough.

17:33.040 --> 17:33.559
Enough?

17:33.559 --> 17:33.960
Yes.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.040
Sure?

17:35.080 --> 17:36.150
Should I give a few more shouts?

17:36.159 --> 17:37.919
No need. That's enough.

17:38.639 --> 17:39.619
Fan,

17:39.639 --> 17:40.590
here you go.

17:40.610 --> 17:41.700
- Eat some flatbread.
- No, thanks.

17:41.720 --> 17:42.119
Eat this.

17:42.119 --> 17:42.910
Keep it for yourself.

17:42.910 --> 17:44.250
Well, I will buy your drinks
the other day.

17:44.250 --> 17:44.899
Sure thing.

17:44.919 --> 17:45.999
Thank you.

18:10.680 --> 18:11.539
Mr. Fan?

18:11.559 --> 18:13.159
Do you recognize me, Mr. Guo?

18:14.800 --> 18:17.679
I have seen your brilliant debate
in the court before.

18:18.040 --> 18:19.120
Uh...

18:20.399 --> 18:23.099
You are the chief examiner this time,
Mr. Guo.

18:23.119 --> 18:24.139
Please don't be so courteous.

18:24.159 --> 18:26.200
[Guo Zheng, Minister of Rites]
Mr. Fan, you are a great prospect.

18:26.200 --> 18:28.639
I know you will go places in the future.

18:28.680 --> 18:29.960
Mr. Fan,

18:30.079 --> 18:31.839
what brings you to the exam hall?

18:32.480 --> 18:34.639
I swing by to visit you.

18:35.079 --> 18:37.460
I have been meaning to meet you.

18:37.480 --> 18:38.480
Please have a seat.

18:38.480 --> 18:39.839
There is no need for that.

18:40.159 --> 18:40.930
Mr. Guo,

18:40.950 --> 18:42.379
may I ask you a question?

18:42.399 --> 18:43.330
Please.

18:43.350 --> 18:45.379
Using poor-quality replacement materials

18:45.399 --> 18:47.930
in the renovation of the exam hall,

18:47.950 --> 18:49.180
are you aware of this?

18:49.200 --> 18:50.919
They are not that bad.

18:51.200 --> 18:53.119
The materials are durable.

18:58.399 --> 19:00.599
In that case, you are aware of this.

19:03.200 --> 19:04.660
If I said I didn't,

19:04.680 --> 19:05.980
wouldn't it be absurd?

19:06.000 --> 19:08.299
Does the Ministry of Revenue
allocate funds for the renovation?

19:08.319 --> 19:09.560
Of course.

19:09.720 --> 19:12.220
We wouldn't dare renovate the premises
without the funds.

19:12.240 --> 19:14.579
Since you are installing
more "durable" materials,

19:14.599 --> 19:15.960
how much money is left?

19:16.480 --> 19:18.700
I believe there are remaining.

19:18.720 --> 19:20.839
Those kiln bricks
and Phoebe Zhennan pillars

19:20.839 --> 19:21.940
are valuable.

19:21.960 --> 19:25.560
They are stored
in the Ministry of Rites' warehouse.

19:25.639 --> 19:28.420
The remaining money is also
recorded in the ledger.

19:28.440 --> 19:31.379
I know you have a lofty ambition.

19:31.399 --> 19:33.660
You vow to fight
against corruption and evil.

19:33.680 --> 19:35.260
I commend you on that.

19:35.280 --> 19:37.260
So I won't overstep your line.

19:37.280 --> 19:38.399
Not a single dime

19:38.720 --> 19:40.280
of this renovation project

19:40.599 --> 19:43.700
has come into my pocket.

19:43.720 --> 19:45.599
My conscience is clear.

19:47.319 --> 19:49.280
If you don't believe me,

19:50.040 --> 19:51.299
feel free to investigate.

19:51.319 --> 19:52.800
The Ministry of Rites
will cooperate fully.

19:52.810 --> 19:54.139
The money is recorded in the ledger?

19:54.159 --> 19:54.819
Fully recorded.

19:54.839 --> 19:56.000
The materials are in the warehouse.

19:56.000 --> 19:57.639
None are missing.

20:01.680 --> 20:03.760
I'm confused.

20:04.480 --> 20:06.560
What are you after

20:07.520 --> 20:08.339
for doing this?

20:08.359 --> 20:11.740
As the Minister of Rites,

20:11.760 --> 20:13.720
I mustn't sit on my hands.

20:14.079 --> 20:15.780
We officials

20:15.800 --> 20:18.040
should do practical things.

20:23.520 --> 20:24.720
Point taken.

20:25.240 --> 20:27.159
The renovation is a practical thing.

20:27.159 --> 20:28.439
It's considered

20:29.000 --> 20:30.480
the political performance.

20:30.800 --> 20:32.240
Political performance?

20:33.520 --> 20:35.320
That's a wise choice of words.

20:35.599 --> 20:37.320
I haven't heard it before.

20:38.000 --> 20:39.439
Political performance.

20:39.760 --> 20:41.560
You even drew yourself a portrait.

20:43.960 --> 20:46.560
It's proof of my contribution.

20:46.639 --> 20:49.619
It will remind me of what I have done.

20:49.639 --> 20:51.000
What about the remaining money?

20:51.010 --> 20:52.630
There are many officials
in the Ministry of Rites.

20:52.639 --> 20:54.740
It's difficult for them
to provide for the family.

20:54.760 --> 20:57.339
Besides, they need money
to buy liquor and meat

20:57.359 --> 20:58.220
during festivals.

20:58.240 --> 20:58.960
Don't you think so?

20:58.980 --> 21:00.960
What about the material
in the warehouse?

21:01.599 --> 21:03.520
We are clean officials.

21:03.720 --> 21:07.020
Some officials might need to repair

21:07.040 --> 21:08.520
their run-down houses.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.740
With the materials in the warehouse.

21:11.760 --> 21:13.220
It's not against the rules.

21:13.240 --> 21:14.780
It's not illegal.

21:14.800 --> 21:16.720
This isn't against the rules.

21:16.839 --> 21:18.240
Absolutely.

21:19.280 --> 21:20.780
Mr. Guo, you have been
in office for years.

21:20.800 --> 21:24.200
You have the court's rules
wrapped around your finger.

21:25.680 --> 21:27.240
I'm clean,

21:27.280 --> 21:29.399
but I need to take care of myself.

21:30.040 --> 21:32.380
Aren't you afraid
that those candidates might find out?

21:32.760 --> 21:34.560
It's no use even if they do.

21:35.000 --> 21:36.800
If someone succeeds in the exam

21:36.800 --> 21:39.119
and impeaches you,
it will be troublesome.

21:39.159 --> 21:41.720
Mr. Fan, like I said,

21:41.960 --> 21:43.839
nothing I do is against the rules.

21:44.280 --> 21:46.379
Besides, these people out there

21:46.399 --> 21:48.159
won't make it through the exam.

21:49.440 --> 21:50.520
What do you mean?

21:52.720 --> 21:53.859
In the coming spring exam,

21:53.879 --> 21:55.500
names on this list

21:55.520 --> 21:58.200
[Record of Spring Exam Hall Renovation]
will be disqualified.

21:58.319 --> 21:59.399
Why is that so?

22:00.319 --> 22:01.740
These candidates

22:01.760 --> 22:03.159
are cunning.

22:03.200 --> 22:05.059
Why did they come here to work?

22:05.079 --> 22:06.480
All they want is

22:06.480 --> 22:08.139
to impress me.

22:08.159 --> 22:11.870
How could we admit
opportunistic candidates like them?

22:12.280 --> 22:13.700
Even though they didn't do anything yet?

22:13.720 --> 22:17.320
Literary men must
have a noble character,

22:18.319 --> 22:19.679
like me.

22:19.760 --> 22:22.280
I can't tolerate shameless fawners.

22:29.800 --> 22:31.760
Is any of these candidates

22:32.879 --> 22:34.520
your retainer?

22:34.680 --> 22:36.679
I just don't want

22:36.800 --> 22:37.940
to go hard on them.

22:37.960 --> 22:41.159
Mr. Fan, one's character
is all that matters.

22:51.040 --> 22:52.240
Look at me.

22:52.480 --> 22:55.879
I unconditionally believe in
your character.

22:57.520 --> 22:59.560
No matter what your intention is,

22:59.839 --> 23:00.899
I won't oppose it.

23:00.919 --> 23:02.159
Have it your way.

23:08.680 --> 23:10.040
Hou Jichang.

23:10.240 --> 23:12.240
You are so capable.

23:12.280 --> 23:14.000
Indeed, Hou Jichang.

23:14.040 --> 23:15.399
You are so hardworking.

23:15.399 --> 23:17.399
It's my duty.

23:17.599 --> 23:19.579
You are so amazing, Hou Jichang.

23:19.599 --> 23:22.159
You have been carrying the logs
a thousand times, right?

23:23.480 --> 23:25.839
Well done, Hou Jichang!

23:26.559 --> 23:29.639
Hou Jichang, great work!

23:29.639 --> 23:31.679
Let's change to another side.

23:32.240 --> 23:35.720
Hou Jichang, great work!

24:14.910 --> 24:16.420
The accommodation fee in the Capital

24:16.440 --> 24:19.200
is too hefty for the candidates.

24:19.960 --> 24:21.420
Poor candidates

24:21.440 --> 24:23.560
have to find a way to make money.

24:25.520 --> 24:27.320
So many of them.

24:27.399 --> 24:28.560
Exactly.

24:28.639 --> 24:30.579
Potential literary men across the world

24:30.599 --> 24:32.960
have gathered in the Capital.

24:44.159 --> 24:45.420
That candidate is quite of age.

24:45.440 --> 24:47.359
I bet he has taken the exam
several times.

24:48.040 --> 24:49.930
He must come here bearing hopes
every time.

24:49.950 --> 24:51.980
Only a few will be selected
from a large pool of candidates.

24:52.000 --> 24:53.839
Not everyone can have the chance.

24:55.159 --> 24:56.740
What does the spring exam mean

24:56.760 --> 24:58.119
to them?

24:58.240 --> 25:00.919
It's the grace from the state.

25:01.040 --> 25:02.120
What else?

25:02.359 --> 25:04.839
As you said,

25:04.919 --> 25:08.059
it's an opportunity
to change their destiny.

25:08.079 --> 25:09.159
Right.

25:09.599 --> 25:11.760
They study hard for years

25:12.040 --> 25:14.079
for this very opportunity.

25:15.520 --> 25:17.760
This is supposed
to be a fair opportunity.

25:24.800 --> 25:27.030
Have you heard about
the spring exam corruption?

25:27.639 --> 25:30.070
Look, the pigeon is plumpy.
It must be from the Imperial Inspectorate.

25:30.079 --> 25:31.780
I doubt it flies the long route.

25:31.800 --> 25:33.079
I... I didn't have anything now.

25:33.079 --> 25:33.720
Otherwise, I would...

25:33.720 --> 25:34.980
Don't deflect.

25:35.000 --> 25:36.560
I was just asking casually.

25:36.870 --> 25:38.320
You can answer it casually.

25:42.720 --> 25:45.079
If so, I will answer it casually.

25:46.480 --> 25:48.220
Before the spring exam begins,

25:48.240 --> 25:51.370
many candidates have already
sought apprenticeships

25:51.390 --> 25:53.439
and offered their services
to dignitaries.

25:54.319 --> 25:55.520
This sorry bunch

25:55.919 --> 25:58.480
secured a guaranteed future
even before the exam.

25:59.960 --> 26:01.399
The exam hall

26:01.599 --> 26:04.159
is merely a smokescreen.

26:37.599 --> 26:38.700
What about them?

26:38.720 --> 26:40.000
They weren't born

26:40.839 --> 26:42.480
with such privileges.

26:42.520 --> 26:44.780
Does the Imperial Inspectorate
not know about this?

26:44.800 --> 26:46.060
They know a thing or two.

26:46.080 --> 26:48.970
Their duty is to monitor the officials.
Why didn't they look into this?

26:50.119 --> 26:51.700
Only big shots

26:51.720 --> 26:54.359
take in disciples.

26:54.480 --> 26:58.110
They are too difficult and influential
to be investigated.

26:58.159 --> 27:00.460
This unwritten rule
has been perpetuated for years.

27:00.480 --> 27:01.660
Everyone got used to that.

27:01.680 --> 27:03.439
But to them,

27:03.720 --> 27:05.599
this is
a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

27:05.720 --> 27:08.960
There are some quotas allocated
for the candidates in the exam hall.

27:20.800 --> 27:22.040
This is just not fair.

27:46.159 --> 27:47.819
What is the name of the inn again?

27:47.839 --> 27:48.700
Tongfu.

27:48.720 --> 27:49.740
Did Fan Xian go there?

27:49.760 --> 27:50.610
Yes.

27:50.630 --> 27:51.480
But the man wasn't there.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.740
So he headed to the exam hall.

27:52.760 --> 27:54.740
To find that Shi what?

27:54.760 --> 27:56.000
Shi Chanli.

27:56.319 --> 27:57.399
He met him,

27:58.040 --> 27:59.560
but they didn't talk much.

27:59.639 --> 28:01.700
Our men watched them from a distance.

28:01.720 --> 28:04.119
They said Shi Chanli didn't look sad.

28:04.280 --> 28:07.720
He probably didn't know
about the massacre in Shijia Town.

28:08.119 --> 28:10.000
He didn't tell him anything?

28:11.040 --> 28:12.539
Then, why did he go there?

28:12.559 --> 28:13.639
Yes, why?

28:15.000 --> 28:16.240
What a wasted trip.

28:17.000 --> 28:18.800
I wonder

28:19.000 --> 28:20.720
what is on Fan Xian's mind.

28:32.760 --> 28:33.840
Mr. Fan,

28:33.960 --> 28:35.139
what are you thinking?

28:35.159 --> 28:36.800
Nothing, really.

28:37.879 --> 28:39.639
The spring exam is in a few days.

28:40.319 --> 28:41.899
I wonder how Shi Chanli
would handle the exam

28:41.919 --> 28:43.760
if he knew what happened
in his hometown.

28:45.399 --> 28:46.480
Let's wait.

28:47.080 --> 28:48.760
The First Division is watching him.

28:49.399 --> 28:52.720
We will see what to do
after he finishes the exam smoothly.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.839
Mr. Fan,

28:56.839 --> 28:58.760
you are really different.

29:01.359 --> 29:02.660
How so?

29:02.680 --> 29:04.760
Other officials

29:05.000 --> 29:06.760
couldn't care less about these people.

29:07.870 --> 29:10.240
At least, we should treat them
with the slightest respect.

29:14.675 --> 29:17.245
[Fan's Residence]

29:25.919 --> 29:27.180
Have we reached home?

29:27.200 --> 29:29.200
You should look at this.

29:37.559 --> 29:39.379
This is for Mr. Fan.

29:39.399 --> 29:41.760
Just a little gift. Please accept it.

29:41.960 --> 29:43.420
Isn't that Xin Qiwu?

29:43.440 --> 29:44.520
It's him.

29:44.960 --> 29:46.299
Some of them also look familiar.

29:46.319 --> 29:47.760
I saw them in the court.

29:47.839 --> 29:49.520
They are in casual clothes now.

29:49.800 --> 29:52.679
It would be inconvenient
if they wore the official robes.

29:52.720 --> 29:54.040
I left a message

29:54.040 --> 29:55.660
inside it.

29:55.680 --> 29:56.899
I shall leave.

29:56.919 --> 29:58.619
Mr. Fan doesn't take gifts.

29:58.639 --> 29:59.619
No gifts.

29:59.639 --> 30:02.040
It's true. Please take it back.

30:02.839 --> 30:04.159
Coming through.

30:05.000 --> 30:05.920
We don't accept gifts.

30:05.940 --> 30:06.790
We don't accept gifts.

30:06.810 --> 30:07.500
He is coming this way.

30:07.520 --> 30:09.299
Please stop giving us the gifts.
We are just servants.

30:09.319 --> 30:10.500
Please stop.

30:10.520 --> 30:12.639
I shall take my leave.

30:18.040 --> 30:19.320
I will put them here.

30:19.430 --> 30:20.960
Please pass them on to Mr. Fan.

30:23.760 --> 30:25.679
It's because of the spring exam?

30:25.960 --> 30:27.119
Apparently.

30:27.440 --> 30:29.520
Come, let's use the back door.

30:54.240 --> 30:54.850
Your Highness,

30:54.870 --> 30:56.130
it doesn't feel right.

30:56.150 --> 30:58.300
How come no one is spotted
in the Fan's Residence?

30:58.359 --> 31:00.079
Because we came in
through the back door.

31:00.079 --> 31:01.859
But this is simply empty.

31:01.879 --> 31:03.399
Do you know why it's empty?

31:03.960 --> 31:05.159
Because

31:05.390 --> 31:07.119
the Fan Residence is in trouble?

31:07.960 --> 31:09.879
Because we haven't been here before.

31:13.800 --> 31:15.780
Where is Fan Xian's courtyard?

31:15.800 --> 31:17.159
Shall we search around?

31:51.359 --> 31:52.559
Put them here.

31:57.040 --> 31:58.220
Go back the same way we came.

31:58.240 --> 31:59.550
Wait for me outside.

32:33.680 --> 32:35.200
It's rotating.

32:35.760 --> 32:36.840
Master,

32:37.040 --> 32:38.379
the Crown Prince came.

32:38.399 --> 32:40.280
Why did you dismiss all the servants?

32:40.559 --> 32:42.040
Did he use the back door?

32:42.359 --> 32:45.280
It doesn't matter which door he used,
he is the Crown Prince.

32:45.520 --> 32:47.980
Now that
you have dismissed the servants,

32:48.000 --> 32:49.299
shouldn't you go and meet him?

32:49.319 --> 32:50.740
He isn't here for me.

32:50.760 --> 32:52.159
I can't go.

32:59.839 --> 33:01.700
Do you know how to navigate

33:01.720 --> 33:03.679
with the volatile officialdom?

33:03.720 --> 33:04.919
How?

33:05.240 --> 33:06.439
Stand steady.

33:07.280 --> 33:09.819
Just mind our own business.

33:09.839 --> 33:11.740
It's better to stay out

33:11.760 --> 33:13.879
of things unrelated to us.

33:16.399 --> 33:17.520
Master,

33:17.911 --> 33:21.059
why did the Crown Prince
come here personally

33:21.079 --> 33:22.420
for Fan Xian?

33:22.440 --> 33:24.139
What else could it be?

33:24.159 --> 33:25.960
The spring exam is around the corner.

33:26.520 --> 33:27.960
He came to give a heads-up.

33:28.879 --> 33:30.839
But why did he use the back door?

33:31.680 --> 33:33.520
Figure this out yourself.

33:35.839 --> 33:37.079
It's not moving.

33:57.919 --> 33:58.999
My goodness.

34:17.399 --> 34:20.039
Your Highness, why did you dismantle it?

34:23.080 --> 34:25.200
I'm sorry, Fan.

34:25.240 --> 34:26.940
It wasn't moving just now,

34:26.960 --> 34:28.200
so I was thinking of fixing it a bit.

34:28.200 --> 34:29.280
Perhaps

34:29.600 --> 34:30.760
I did it too much.

34:31.080 --> 34:31.939
Well,

34:31.959 --> 34:34.640
how much is this? I will pay you back.

34:34.839 --> 34:37.280
I was joking.
Please get out of the water.

34:38.600 --> 34:39.680
All right.

34:41.399 --> 34:43.879
What brings you here, Your Highness?

34:46.080 --> 34:47.810
Do you want to listen
to the truth or the lie?

34:47.830 --> 34:49.240
I'm fine with either of them.

34:50.479 --> 34:51.660
I came here to talk you out.

34:51.680 --> 34:52.959
Of what?

34:53.039 --> 34:54.540
Because of your fallout with Chengze,

34:54.560 --> 34:56.160
he is grounded for six months.

34:56.319 --> 34:58.459
I feel bad for my own brother.

34:58.479 --> 35:00.200
That's why I must come to advise you.

35:01.399 --> 35:02.760
This is a lie.

35:04.919 --> 35:06.280
Apparently.

35:07.230 --> 35:08.600
What about the truth?

35:08.640 --> 35:10.000
Speaking of the truth...

35:14.359 --> 35:15.479
I'm coming.

35:18.999 --> 35:19.940
Did anyone call him?

35:19.960 --> 35:21.399
As long as he believes so.

35:23.200 --> 35:24.280
The truth is

35:25.120 --> 35:26.859
you upset Chengze,

35:26.879 --> 35:29.100
which made me thrilled.

35:29.120 --> 35:32.020
So I brought some gifts to you.

35:32.040 --> 35:33.940
Your Highness, you surely
didn't see me as an outsider.

35:33.960 --> 35:35.280
You and Chengze are fighting each other.

35:35.280 --> 35:36.780
Of course we are on the same side.

35:36.800 --> 35:38.340
But I don't know what you like.

35:38.360 --> 35:39.919
These are valuables, jewels,
and precious herbs.

35:39.919 --> 35:41.439
I prepared some of everything.

35:41.680 --> 35:42.660
Thank you, Your Highness.

35:42.680 --> 35:43.800
I like them all.

35:45.319 --> 35:46.600
Good that you are frank.

36:03.959 --> 36:06.800
I suppose you didn't come here
only to send gifts, Your Highness.

36:08.040 --> 36:09.580
Well, that's the main reason.

36:09.600 --> 36:10.580
Main reason?

36:10.600 --> 36:12.200
I also have some trivial matters.

36:12.640 --> 36:13.760
How trivial is it?

36:16.519 --> 36:18.320
Just some trivial names.

36:20.919 --> 36:22.359
You are in charge

36:23.160 --> 36:26.720
of the anonymous transcription, right?

36:26.760 --> 36:29.879
[Song Changning, Wei Sinan, Sheng Huaiyuan]
Pay attention to these names.

36:31.999 --> 36:33.959
What do you want me to do,
Your Highness?

36:34.480 --> 36:35.980
You don't have to do anything.

36:36.000 --> 36:37.859
Do nothing
during the anonymous transcription.

36:37.879 --> 36:38.999
That's all I need.

36:39.960 --> 36:41.140
Well, there's nothing else.

36:41.160 --> 36:42.280
I should get going.

36:43.160 --> 36:43.899
Initially,

36:43.919 --> 36:45.780
my men were supposed
to send these gifts over.

36:45.800 --> 36:48.160
But then, I thought
we were on the same side.

36:48.200 --> 36:50.680
Also, I missed you,
so I came here myself

36:51.039 --> 36:52.600
to show my sincerity.

36:52.839 --> 36:54.519
You truly are sincere, Your Highness.

36:54.959 --> 36:56.559
There is a survivor in Shijia Town.

36:56.720 --> 36:58.039
You heard about that too?

36:58.999 --> 37:01.419
It concerns Chengze's smuggling.

37:01.439 --> 37:03.250
Naturally, I will pay attention to that.

37:03.270 --> 37:04.760
Is anything worth mentioning?

37:04.919 --> 37:05.960
He is a candidate.

37:05.980 --> 37:07.100
I haven't told him anything yet.

37:07.120 --> 37:09.720
I will wait until the exam is over.

37:12.720 --> 37:13.919
As you say.

37:14.200 --> 37:15.210
I'm leaving.

37:15.230 --> 37:16.439
No need to see me off.

37:16.479 --> 37:17.720
I will find my way out.

37:18.160 --> 37:20.320
Just go in the opposite direction
of the arrow.

37:35.280 --> 37:36.360
Mr. Fan,

37:36.519 --> 37:38.260
here's a letter from Prime Minister Lin.

37:38.280 --> 37:40.600
He sends for you.

37:50.320 --> 37:51.999
[Yuan Hongdao,
counselor of Prime Minister Lin]

37:51.999 --> 37:53.079
Sir,

37:53.479 --> 37:55.280
is this name all right?

37:56.160 --> 37:57.280
Yes.

38:15.919 --> 38:16.999
Mr. Lin.

38:18.280 --> 38:19.640
Do away with formalities.

38:19.879 --> 38:20.959
Come here

38:21.120 --> 38:22.399
and help me.

38:24.519 --> 38:25.800
Lately,

38:26.240 --> 38:28.439
my beard has grown
quite a few white hairs.

38:29.120 --> 38:30.320
Right, there are.

38:32.760 --> 38:34.680
Pull them out for me.

38:35.359 --> 38:36.439
Me?

38:37.039 --> 38:38.800
I can't do this myself.

38:38.839 --> 38:40.120
It hurts.

39:00.519 --> 39:02.959
Come again.

39:03.720 --> 39:04.879
Quick.

39:15.120 --> 39:16.720
One more time.

39:17.359 --> 39:18.439
Pull it off.

39:19.359 --> 39:20.240
No...

39:20.240 --> 39:21.879
Stop here.

39:23.240 --> 39:24.559
Mr. Lin,

39:24.839 --> 39:26.800
I don't think it's that painful.

39:26.959 --> 39:29.959
I can't bear the pain. I'm scared.

39:30.120 --> 39:32.100
Why don't you just trim them?

39:32.120 --> 39:33.800
They still grow.

39:34.160 --> 39:36.120
It doesn't solve the problem.

39:40.160 --> 39:41.760
Let's stop here for today.

39:42.760 --> 39:43.840
Sir,

39:44.439 --> 39:45.780
his background is clean.

39:45.800 --> 39:46.479
All right.

39:46.479 --> 39:48.420
[Huan Xianzhong
of Heinan Circuit in Xuzhou]

39:52.280 --> 39:53.360
Fan Xian.

39:54.999 --> 39:56.160
Look.

39:56.560 --> 39:58.039
My beard

39:58.439 --> 40:00.039
is neat, right?

40:00.319 --> 40:01.399
Refined.

40:02.319 --> 40:03.559
Good.

40:04.760 --> 40:07.439
Being an official is similar to
how we comport ourselves.

40:07.519 --> 40:08.919
Be mindful

40:09.039 --> 40:10.180
of small details.

40:10.200 --> 40:11.720
Most importantly,

40:11.879 --> 40:14.110
don't expose anything
that will give yourself away.

40:18.959 --> 40:20.680
Mr. Lin, what is this?

40:22.519 --> 40:24.999
Dabao likes eating hawthorns.

40:25.760 --> 40:27.600
I'm picking good ones for him.

40:30.120 --> 40:32.559
He always eats eagerly.

40:32.999 --> 40:35.919
I'm afraid he might choke on the seeds.

40:36.080 --> 40:37.359
Mr. Fan,

40:37.439 --> 40:39.339
he won't let servants

40:39.359 --> 40:42.240
do this.

40:46.959 --> 40:48.670
Did the Crown Prince come to you?

40:50.120 --> 40:51.399
Word spreads fast.

40:51.919 --> 40:53.620
Did he give you a name list?

40:53.640 --> 40:54.720
Yes.

40:55.600 --> 40:57.680
He asked me not to do anything

40:57.810 --> 40:59.100
during the anonymous transcription.

40:59.120 --> 41:00.999
Indeed, you don't have to do anything.

41:01.640 --> 41:03.439
Someone will handle it.

41:03.879 --> 41:05.459
You only need to turn a blind eye.

41:05.479 --> 41:06.580
To what?

41:06.600 --> 41:08.280
What else could it be?

41:08.310 --> 41:10.220
Let them put the names
of the selected ones

41:10.240 --> 41:11.919
on the honor roll.

41:12.275 --> 41:13.315
[Spring Metropolitan Exam]

41:13.317 --> 41:15.620
[Yun Heshun of Heinan Circuit
in Laizhou, No. 13 of East]

41:19.600 --> 41:22.555
[No. 13 of East]

41:22.575 --> 41:24.295
[Examiner Sealer's seal]

41:45.519 --> 41:48.200
Pick the chosen candidates out
during the procedure?

41:48.200 --> 41:51.680
These people will definitely
make it onto the honor roll.

41:56.039 --> 41:57.879
What if their essays
aren't well-written?

41:57.999 --> 41:59.060
Won't anyone suspect that?

41:59.080 --> 42:00.879
There is always a way.

42:01.200 --> 42:04.499
That's why your position
is very crucial.

42:04.519 --> 42:05.959
Do you know

42:06.200 --> 42:13.080
how many name lists
those officials and dignitaries will send to you?

42:13.560 --> 42:14.620
I do.

42:14.640 --> 42:16.919
People have been sending gifts
these days.

42:16.999 --> 42:18.299
They didn't leave their names,

42:18.319 --> 42:20.839
but there is a note
behind each gift box.

42:21.039 --> 42:23.039
Pay no mind to those.

42:26.839 --> 42:28.399
The important names

42:29.439 --> 42:30.959
are all here.

42:32.519 --> 42:33.919
Why do you have them?

42:34.120 --> 42:35.519
I intercepted the gifts

42:35.839 --> 42:38.559
and had Mr. Yuan filter out the names.

42:39.359 --> 42:41.280
The list is shorter now.

42:41.959 --> 42:44.080
Just remember these names.

42:48.416 --> 42:49.540
Isn't this the spring exam?

42:49.560 --> 42:51.260
Shouldn't they pass the exam
by their merit?

42:51.280 --> 42:53.600
These aren't just names.

42:54.160 --> 42:56.200
This is how
the bureaucratic world works.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
